# Ecology notes - week 3

## Keystone species

A keystone species has a disproportionately large effect on its ecosystem
relative to its population size.

.row alignment:{spaceevenly}
    .clip {circle} 
        !(75)[](https://blog.nwf.org/wp-content/blogs.dir/11/files/2012/09/Sea-Otter-LeDent.jpg)

